sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If as many numbers as we please beginning from a unit are in continued proportion, and the number after the unit is square, then all the rest are also square; and if the number after the unit is cubic, then all the rest are also cubic.
----
proof:

Let there be as many numbers as we please, {A}, {B}, {C}, {D}, {E}, and {F}, beginning from a unit and in continued proportion, and let {A}, the number after the unit, be square.

